subsetdef: omim_susceptibility "OMIM entry with braces, e.g. {}, which indicate mutations that contribute to susceptibility to multifactorial disorders (e.g., diabetes, asthma) or to susceptibility to infection (e.g., malaria)."
subsetdef: ordo_biological_anomaly "biological anomaly"
